From: W1nkelm4nn <mrmarkap61@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:27:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kk, wsi/metal: Upscale swapchain images with MetalFX

With MESA_WSI_METAL_UPSCALING=metalfx the drawables get the size of the
window in pixels of the screen, which Wine's layers do not report through
contentsScale. The blit into the drawable then runs MetalFX's spatial
scaler for Metal 4 into a private texture and copies that to the
drawable, with alpha forced to one, as the layer is not opaque.

